<!--
  Themed icon layer (Android 13+), where the launcher discards these colours and re tints the whole
  shape to the wallpaper.

  Same geometry as the foreground, with two differences that only matter once everything is one
  colour: the strokes are heavier, because a tinted icon is often drawn low contrast against its own
  background and hairlines disappear there, and the horizon and sun stay real evenOdd holes rather
  than painted shapes, since a painted shape in the same tint as its surroundings is invisible.
-->
